  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Global.Text 103031 'Thugamug' (title), 103748 (card), objective 103750; icon 310."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "Starter at [-1831.37, -54.35, -45.58]: BJX fork Battles.lua:78 (Npcs.json Id 46251, chugawug_m_bandit_01.adr). (R) the fork's own placement, not a captured one. Region The Wilds, place The Wilds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 85 ('Thugamug (the live random encounter: Thugamug's toll bridge)'): scene sg_random_encounter_creek, entry, exit, 3 waves, 10 spawns ({'Thugamug Henchman': 5, 'Bandit Patrolman': 2, 'Thugamug': 1, \"Thugamug's Right Hand\": 1, \"Thugamug's Left Hand\": 1})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1243 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene sg_random_encounter_creek has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 45 coins / 180 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) rc-0137 prize wheel (2026-11-12): 'Thugamug' has no wheel on the wiki, no shipped dungeon record and no item page that names its prize wheel, so it spins the wheel of 'Nettleseed Nibblers!' (fandom revision 10367), the battle of difficulty 3 nearest its own 3, and 54 coins."
    }
  ]
